cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use localddi, please cite it, and cite the data sources you imported
  (DDInter and RxNorm), which are separate works with their own terms.
title: "localddi: a self-hosted drug-drug interaction API"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Joshi
    given-names: Shubham
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shubhamjoshipromail-svg/localddi"
abstract: >-
  A self-hosted HTTP API that answers drug-drug interaction queries by RxCUI or
  drug name from locally imported data, with endpoints that follow the JSON
  shape of the discontinued NLM RxNav Drug Interaction API. Not for clinical use.
keywords:
  - drug-drug interactions
  - RxNorm
  - RxNav
  - self-hosted
references:
  - type: article
    title: "DDInter: an online drug-drug interaction database towards improving clinical decision-making and patient safety"
    authors:
      - family-names: Xiong
        given-names: Guoli
      - name: "et al."
    journal: "Nucleic Acids Research"
    year: 2022
    doi: 10.1093/nar/gkab880
  - type: data
    title: "RxNorm Current Prescribable Content"
    authors:
      - name: "U.S. National Library of Medicine"
    url: "https://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm/docs/prescribe.html"
